  )
  (text "IN-LINE INTERCEPTOR.  The handset keeps its factory wiring and still switches motor current in OEM mode." (at 48.00 545.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "88224486-52a1-53f6-ba6a-41d1872f953c")
  )
  (text "This board cuts into the 4-core cable between handset and motor housing; unplug it and rejoin the cable" (at 48.00 550.60 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "49450d02-c9d9-5610-afc9-34b63ce0eef3")
  )
  (text "to return the desk to stock." (at 48.00 556.20 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "1a70470b-ea18-5162-80d7-e061707baadc")
  )
  (text "K3 / K4 / K5 share one coil node and act as a 3-pole transfer:" (at 48.00 567.40 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9d0d9b82-ef67-5707-9e31-0a13c7b59b60")
  )
  (text "    de-energised  ->  handset sees VSW and drives the winding   (STOCK BEHAVIOUR)" (at 48.00 573.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f95660ee-481b-57a7-9915-18a99b2642e4")
  )
  (text "    energised     ->  handset sees +3V3 and is isolated from the winding" (at 48.00 578.60 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "3bd8b124-1c53-5898-8964-3c8f14586b58")
  )
  (text "Power loss or a watchdog timeout drops the transfer and hands the desk back to the rockers." (at 48.00 584.20 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "71f4ab12-4114-5cec-8dba-2707490c1174")
  )
  (text "K1 / K2 give brake at rest exactly as the OEM rockers do.  Both off -> both winding ends on VSW." (at 48.00 595.40 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "3fb3e6be-b7c7-5529-b3cc-de8a0bbfc0c3")
  )
  (text "No combination of relay states can short the supply; there is no shoot-through failure mode." (at 48.00 601.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9a85a0b9-a09f-517e-9df8-2c85aaf01819")
  )
  (text "SEQUENCING: relays change state only with Q1 off and current decayed.  On a watchdog trip Q1 turns off" (at 48.00 612.20 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f15d014a-b7c5-5388-b437-712202a6b6e0")
  )
  (text "in microseconds while relays take milliseconds to release, so contacts are cold-switched even in a fault." (at 48.00 617.80 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "7b216bd7-1366-54a6-8f4e-921b3bcb2e57")
  )
  (text "U5 sits after the transfer relay, in the motor leg proper, so it reads current in BOTH modes." (at 48.00 629.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e7bd73eb-f7cf-53f0-9e26-fbd70d4e90e5")
  )
  (text "K3 / K4 carry full motor current in OEM mode - rate them for the load." (at 48.00 634.60 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6c99e9f3-0e7d-54b4-b721-d63aaff64077")
  )
  (text "R1/R2/R6/R12 must sit on non-strapping GPIOs.  ISENSE must be on ADC1 (ADC2 is unusable with WiFi)." (at 48.00 640.20 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "37a0ecfe-decf-50f4-9e38-9140631589f5")
  )
  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
  )
)
